<title>USA: Allied optimistic on sales and fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Allied optimistic on sales and fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ga. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Holdings Inc said Thursday it is optimistic on new vehicle sales trends in both Canada and the United States and expects the trend to continue for the rest of the year.</p>
<p>Allied Holdings also said Allied Automotive Group, its largest subsidiary, should benefit from lower fuel prices for the remainder of 1997.</p>
</text>
